at least","type":"prep phr","meaning_vi":"ít nhất","example":null,"category":"Giới từ đi kèm"},{"id":289,"word":"in danger","type":"prep phr","meaning_vi":"gặp nguy hiểm","example":null,"category":"Giới từ đi kèm"},{"id":290,"word":"by mistake","type":"prep phr","meaning_vi":"do nhầm lẫn","example":null,"category":"Giới từ đi kèm"},{"id":291,"word":"a piece of cake","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"dễ như ăn bánh","example":"The exam was a piece of cake.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":292,"word":"break the ice","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"phá vỡ bầu không khí ngại ngùng","example":"He told a joke to break the ice.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":293,"word":"under the weather","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"hơi mệt, không khỏe","example":"I'm feeling a bit under the weather.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":294,"word":"once in a blue moon","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"rất hiếm khi","example":"I eat fast food once in a blue moon.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":295,"word":"hit the nail on the head","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"nói trúng vấn đề","example":"You've hit the nail on the head.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":296,"word":"cost an arm and a leg","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"rất đắt","example":"That car cost an arm and a leg.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":297,"word":"keep an eye on","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"để mắt tới, trông chừng","example":"Can you keep an eye on my bag?","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":298,"word":"get cold feet","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"chùn bước (vào phút chót)","example":"He got cold feet before the wedding.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":299,"word":"in the long run","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"về lâu dài","example":"Exercise will help you in the long run.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":300,"word":"by heart","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"thuộc lòng","example":"I know the poem by heart.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":301,"word":"out of the blue","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"bất ngờ, không báo trước","example":"She called me out of the blue.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":302,"word":"call it a day","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"nghỉ, kết thúc công việc","example":"We're tired, let's call it a day.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":303,"word":"the last straw","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"giọt nước tràn ly","example":"His rudeness was the last straw.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":304,"word":"on the go","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"bận rộn liên tục","example":"I've been on the go all day.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":305,"word":"make ends meet","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"kiếm đủ sống","example":"They struggle to make ends meet.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":306,"word":"a waste of time","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"phí thời gian","example":"That meeting was a waste of time.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":307,"word":"be in two minds","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"phân vân","example":"I'm in two minds about the job.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":308,"word":"change your mind","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"đổi ý","example":"She changed her mind at the last minute.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":309,"word":"make up your mind","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"quyết định","example":"Have you made up your mind yet?","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":310,"word":"take something for granted","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"coi là đương nhiên","example":"Don't take your health for granted.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":311,"word":"at the last minute","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"vào phút chót","example":"He cancelled at the last minute.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":312,"word":"for the time being","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"tạm thời","example":"I'm staying here for the time being.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":313,"word":"it's no use + V-ing","type":"structure","meaning_vi":"vô ích khi làm gì","example":"It's no use complaining.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":314,"word":"can't help + V-ing","type":"structure","meaning_vi":"không thể không làm gì","example":"I can't help laughing.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":315,"word":"there's no point in + V-ing","type":"structure","meaning_vi":"chẳng ích gì khi làm gì","example":"There's no point in waiting.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":316,"word":"it's worth + V-ing","type":"structure","meaning_vi":"đáng để làm gì","example":"The museum is worth visiting.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":317,"word":"be on the point of + V-ing","type":"structure","meaning_vi":"sắp sửa làm gì","example":"I was on the point of leaving.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":318,"word":"no wonder","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"chẳng trách, thảo nào","example":"No wonder you're tired.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":319,"word":"as a matter of fact","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"thực ra","example":"As a matter of fact, I disagree.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":320,"word":"from time to time","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"thỉnh thoảng","example":"I see him from time to time.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":321,"word":"sooner or later","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"sớm hay muộn","example":"Sooner or later you'll have to decide.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":322,"word":"now and then","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"thỉnh thoảng","example":"We meet now and then.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":323,"word":"on the whole","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"nhìn chung","example":"On the whole, it was a good trip.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":324,"word":"all of a sudden","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"đột nhiên","example":"All of a sudden, the lights went out.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":325,"word":"at first sight","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"ngay cái nhìn đầu tiên","example":"It was love at first sight.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":326,"word":"in the end","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"cuối cùng","example":"In the end, we took a taxi.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":327,"word":"out of date","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"lỗi thời, hết hạn","example":"This map is out of date.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":328,"word":"up to date","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"cập nhật, hiện đại","example":"Keep your software up to date.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":329,"word":"lose your temper","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"nổi nóng","example":"He lost his temper with the kids.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":330,"word":"keep your fingers crossed","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"cầu may","example":"Keep your fingers crossed for me!","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":331,"word":"see eye to eye","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"đồng quan điểm","example":"We don't always see eye to eye.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":332,"word":"face to face","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"trực tiếp, mặt đối mặt","example":"I'd rather discuss it face to face.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":333,"word":"make a fuss","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"làm ầm lên","example":"Don't make a fuss about it.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":334,"word":"behind the times","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"lạc hậu","example":"My parents are a bit behind the times.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":335,"word":"learn the ropes","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"học cách làm (việc mới)","example":"It took me a week to learn the ropes.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":336,"word":"have second thoughts","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"nghĩ lại, do dự","example":"I'm having second thoughts about the trip.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":337,"word":"in the nick of time","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"vừa kịp lúc","example":"We arrived in the nick of time.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":338,"word":"give someone a hand","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"giúp ai một tay","example":"Can you give me a hand with these boxes?","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":339,"word":"get the hang of","type":"idiom","meaning_vi":"nắm được cách làm","example":"You'll soon get the hang of it.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":340,"word":"have a lot in common","type":"expr","meaning_vi":"có nhiều điểm chung","example":"We have a lot in common.","category":"Thành ngữ & cụm cố định"},{"id":341,"word":"however","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"tuy nhiên","example":"It was expensive. However, it was worth it.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":342,"word":"nevertheless","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"tuy vậy, dù sao","example":"It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":343,"word":"although","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"mặc dù (+ mệnh đề)","example":"Although it was late, she kept working.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":344,"word":"even though","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"mặc dù (nhấn mạnh)","example":"Even though he's rich, he's not happy.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":345,"word":"despite","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"mặc dù (+ N/V-ing)","example":"Despite the rain, we enjoyed the trip.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":346,"word":"in spite of","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"mặc dù (+ N/V-ing)","example":"In spite of feeling ill, she went to work.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":347,"word":"whereas","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"trong khi (đối lập)","example":"I love tea, whereas my wife prefers coffee.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":348,"word":"while","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"trong khi; mặc dù","example":"While I understand your point, I disagree.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":349,"word":"on the other hand","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"mặt khác","example":"On the other hand, cities are expensive.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":350,"word":"on the contrary","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"ngược lại","example":"It wasn't boring. On the contrary, it was great.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":351,"word":"moreover","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"hơn nữa","example":"The flat is cheap. Moreover, it's central.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":352,"word":"furthermore","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"hơn nữa, ngoài ra","example":"Furthermore, the service was excellent.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":353,"word":"in addition","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"thêm vào đó","example":"In addition, students get free meals.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":354,"word":"besides","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"ngoài ra; bên cạnh đó","example":"Besides, it's too late to go now.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":355,"word":"what is more","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"hơn thế nữa","example":"What is more, it's free.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":356,"word":"as well as","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"cũng như, cùng với","example":"She speaks French as well as English.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":357,"word":"therefore","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"do đó","example":"He was ill; therefore, he stayed at home.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":358,"word":"consequently","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"kết quả là","example":"Consequently, prices went up.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":359,"word":"as a result","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"kết quả là","example":"As a result, many people lost their jobs.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":360,"word":"thus","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"vì vậy","example":"Thus, the plan failed.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":361,"word":"because of","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"bởi vì (+ N)","example":"The flight was delayed because of fog.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":362,"word":"due to","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"do, bởi (+ N)","example":"The delay was due to bad weather.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":363,"word":"owing to","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"do, vì (+ N)","example":"Owing to illness, he missed the exam.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":364,"word":"since","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"vì; kể từ khi","example":"Since you're here, you can help me.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":365,"word":"as long as","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"miễn là","example":"You can go as long as you're back by ten.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":366,"word":"provided that","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"với điều kiện là","example":"Provided that you study, you'll pass.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":367,"word":"unless","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"trừ khi","example":"You'll fail unless you study.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":368,"word":"in case","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"phòng khi","example":"Take an umbrella in case it rains.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":369,"word":"so that","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"để mà (+ mệnh đề)","example":"I left early so that I wouldn't be late.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":370,"word":"in order to","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"để (+ V)","example":"She saved money in order to travel.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":371,"word":"so as to","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"để (+ V)","example":"I whispered so as not to wake the baby.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":372,"word":"for instance","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"ví dụ","example":"Some sports, for instance tennis, are expensive.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":373,"word":"for example","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"ví dụ","example":"Many cities, for example Paris, are crowded.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":374,"word":"such as","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"chẳng hạn như","example":"I like fruit such as apples and oranges.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":375,"word":"in conclusion","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"kết luận lại","example":"In conclusion, both options have benefits.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":376,"word":"to sum up","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"tóm lại","example":"To sum up, technology has changed our lives.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":377,"word":"firstly","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"trước hết","example":"Firstly, it saves time.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":378,"word":"finally","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"cuối cùng","example":"Finally, it's good for the environment.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":379,"word":"in my opinion","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"theo ý kiến của tôi","example":"In my opinion, schools should start later.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":380,"word":"on balance","type":"linker","meaning_vi":"cân nhắc mọi mặt thì","example":"On balance, I think it's a good idea.","category":"Từ nối"},{"id":381,"word":"act","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"hành động","example":"action, active, actively, activity, inactive, actor","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":382,"word":"achieve","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"đạt được","example":"achievement, achievable, unachievable","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":383,"word":"advertise","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"quảng cáo","example":"advertisement, advertiser, advertising","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":384,"word":"agree","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"đồng ý","example":"agreement, agreeable, disagree, disagreement","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":385,"word":"appear","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"xuất hiện","example":"appearance, disappear, disappearance, apparent, apparently","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":386,"word":"attract","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"thu hút","example":"attraction, attractive, unattractive, attractively","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":387,"word":"believe","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"tin","example":"belief, believable, unbelievable, unbelievably","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":388,"word":"care","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"quan tâm, cẩn thận","example":"careful, careless, carelessness, carefully","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":389,"word":"compete","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"cạnh tranh, thi đấu","example":"competition, competitive, competitor","category":"Họ từ (Word formation)"},{"id":390,"word":"comfort","type":"word family","meaning_vi":"sự thoải mái","example":"comfortable, uncomfortable, comfortab